Base heating setpoint (prior to any offset applied).

\paragraph{Distribution Data Sources}
% \input{characteristics/sources/Heating Setpoint}
\begin{itemize}
\item Constructed using U.S.~EIA 2020 RECS microdata.
\end{itemize}

\paragraph{Direct Conditional Dependencies}
\input{characteristics/dependencies/Heating Setpoint}

\paragraph{Options}
The options for heating setpoint are shown in Table \ref{table:hc_opt_heating_setpoint}. All setpoints that are assigned 55\degree F are vacant units. The heating set points are the same for weekdays and weekends. Heating systems are assumed to be run as needed year-round.

